# A bound on a table of field offsets. `v` lies behind one, two or three inherited fields, so the read and the store in `weigh` and the read in the loop look up where it lies.
# Only an inherited prefix pins a field: below one base, in unrelated classes and in literals `v` lies at one offset and there is no table. So the count is held.
# f1 = weigh
